mlx-relayvsr-swift
Port of RelayVSR (https://github.com/kopperx/RelayVSR @ e856773350f53036d825404c9ea9228e6dffadca):
  RelayVSR authors (Xijun Wang, Xin Li, Zirui Lang, Suhang Yao, Haoran Li, Zhibo Chen). Licensed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0.
RelayVSR's reference generator is the Wan2.2 architecture (https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2) in its Diffusers form
(https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers): both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The RelayVSR checkpoints (https://huggingface.co/kopper/RelayVSR) are Apache-2.0 from their authors and are not
included in this repository. The MLX-layout conversion (oracle/convert_weights.py) is published at
https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/RelayVSR-bf16.
